    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StC, S0)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_0RB1LA_1LC1RB_0RA1LD_1LC0LC [SWin 2; SWinR 1] (StC, S0) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
